<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To develop an AI-driven object personality that can communicate with people about its own characteristics, experiences, and surroundings using historical, real-time, and contextual data. By giving objects such as benches, statues, trees, or bushes a voice and a personality, we want to bring the city to life and create a new type of interaction between people and their environment. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Besides offering information we want to explore how these interactive objects can generate social value. For example, they can help to reduce feelings of loneliness by offering a friendly conversation or supporting tourists by sharing their stories and learning facts about the city. Ultimately the goal is to demonstrate how AI can be used to strengthen the relationship between humans, residents, visitors and their city, and how technology can play a role in creating a more connected environment. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
